flowchart LR
    SourceDB[(源数据库)]

    subgraph platform [迁移平台]
        direction TB
        subgraph control [集中管控]
            Console[控制台]
            OpenAPI[OpenAPI]
            Auth[身份认证]
            Perm[权限 Permission]
            Audit[审计 Audit]
            Crypto[加解密 Crypto]
        end
        subgraph base [基础服务]
            CM[集群管理]
            RM[资源管理]
            HA[高可用]
            Meta[元数据管理]
        end
        subgraph full [结构与全量]
            Collect[结构采集与转化]
            SchemaMig[结构迁移]
            FullFlow[全量数据流]
        end
        AI[AI智能_映射建议与异常诊断]
        subgraph incr [增量管道]
            LogRead[日志读取_Reader_Filter_Queue]
            SyncWrite[同步写入_Filter_Mapping_冲突检测]
            LogRead <--> SyncWrite
        end
    end

    TargetDB[(目标数据库)]
    MQ[消息队列]

    SourceDB <--> platform
    platform <--> TargetDB
    platform --> MQ
